---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import Button from "./Button.astro";
import heroImg from "../assets/fotos/05.jpg";
---
<section id="topo" class="relative overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-16 sm:pt-36 lg:pb-24">
  <!-- Iluminação ambiente -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[36rem] w-[36rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand/30 blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-accent/15 blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07] [background-image:linear-gradient(rgb(255_255_255/.6)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgb(255_255_255/.6)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:56px_56px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,black,transparent_70%)]"
    ></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-x relative grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <p class="pill animate-blur-in">
        <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-soft"></span>
        Certificação internacional AHA &amp; HSI
      </p>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 animate-blur-in text-4xl leading-[1.05] font-bold tracking-tight [animation-delay:120ms] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl"
      >
        Dominar o procedimento é o primeiro passo para
        <span class="text-gradient">agir com confiança.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl animate-blur-in text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted [animation-delay:240ms] sm:text-xl">
        Cursos ACLS e BLS com médicos que vivem a emergência todos os dias. Treino prático, em simulação realista,
        para você agir com segurança quando cada segundo conta.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-9 flex animate-blur-in flex-col gap-3 [animation-delay:360ms] sm:flex-row">
        <Button cta="inscricao" pos="hero">Garantir minha vaga</Button>
        <Button cta="whatsapp" pos="hero">Falar no WhatsApp</Button>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-9 flex animate-blur-in flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-muted [animation-delay:480ms]">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-accent-soft">✦</span> Instrutores médicos</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-accent-soft">✦</span> Prática com manequins e simuladores</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-accent-soft">✦</span> Do básico ao avançado</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="relative animate-blur-in [animation-delay:200ms] lg:col-span-5">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand/40 to-accent/10 blur-2xl"></div>
      <figure class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-blue-500/20 shadow-2xl shadow-brand/20">
        <Picture
          src={heroImg}
          formats={["avif", "webp"]}
          widths={[400, 640, 900]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw"
          alt="Alunos do ITS treinando desfibrilação e ventilação em manequim, com monitor de simulação ao fundo"
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover sm:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-[4/5]"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
        <figcaption class="glass absolute right-4 bottom-4 left-4 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm">
          <span class="relative flex size-2.5">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex size-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex size-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          </span>
          Simulação realista de parada cardiorrespiratória
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
